 Story","authors":["Greg Weisman"],"date":"2019-05-08","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/war-spark-ravnica-old-friends-and-new-2019-05-08","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/war-spark-ravnica-old-friends-and-new-2019-05-08#:~:text=The%20rest%20of%20the,another%20than%20of%20Bolas.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"War of the Spark: Ravnica—Old Friends and New\" by Greg Weisman. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 8 May 2019."}},{"id":"war-spark-ravnica-old-friends-and-new-2019-05-08-e15","summary":"Kaya tells Rat that Hekara is dead, devastating Rat.","participants":["kaya","rat","hekara"],"location":"tenth-district-plaza","importance":"major","page":"stories/war-spark-ravnica-old-friends-and-new-2019-05-08","order":384,"story_date":"2019-05-08","storyline":"War of the Spark","source":"wizards","paragraph":234,"quote":"Hekara's dead,","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/war-spark-ravnica-old-friends-and-new-2019-05-08#:~:text=Hekara%27s%20dead%2C","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"War of the Spark: Ravnica—Old Friends and New","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Greg Weisman"],"date":"2019-05-08","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/war-spark-ravnica-old-friends-and-new-2019-05-08","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/war-spark-ravnica-old-friends-and-new-2019-05-08#:~:text=Hekara%27s%20dead%2C","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"War of the Spark: Ravnica—Old Friends and New\" by Greg Weisman. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 8 May 2019."}},{"id":"war-spark-ravnica-path-opulent-2019-05-15-e10","summary":"Four God-Eternals emerge from the portal over Tenth District Plaza, and Samut identifies them as her plane's gods, now Bolas's servants.","participants":["god-eternals","samut","nicol-bolas","kaya"],"location":"tenth-district-plaza","importance":"major","page":"stories/war-spark-ravnica-path-opulent-2019-05-15